===Etymology 1===
{{inh+|ru|orv|бѣлъка||squirrel}}, diminutive of {{m|orv|бѣла||squirrel}} (see {{m|ru|-ка}}), from {{m|orv|[[бѣла]] [[вѣверица]]||white squirrel}}, from {{inh|ru|sla-pro|*bělъka}}. See {{m|ru|бе́лый||white}}, {{m|ru|ве́верица||squirrel; ermine, stoat}}.
{{wp|ru:}}

